37,2,1,talk,George,,"@Toshio, the other households said asking favours sours things. Our own checking spell made people feel accused. We must avoid repeating that.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"@George, the diary shows Saturday usage is triple Tuesday’s. That imbalance drives the friction. I need to see if the handover state reflects that neglect.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"@Toshio, the mechanic confirmed short cold runs destroy the battery. That explains why I find it dead on Tuesday mornings.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"@Toshio, the receipts show two people bought over half the fuel. The trial recording took an hour weekly. We need a system that doesn’t rely on constant verification.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,1,talk,Minato,,"@Misaki, that sounds heavy. I found the same thing. Two people bought most of the fuel, and Saturdays are much busier than Tuesdays.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,George,,"@Misaki, an hour weekly is too much. The other households said constant asking sours trust. We need a system that removes the need to verify.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Misaki, an hour weekly is the exact labor I am trying to eliminate. The handover state proves the current system fails. We need a structure that removes the need for constant checking.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Toshio, I agree. The handover state is unacceptable. We need a baseline condition so I am not driving a neglected vehicle.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Victoria, a baseline is good, but it doesn't fix the math. The receipts show the split is already broken. We need a formula that accounts for actual usage, not just equal shares.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Misaki, I agree. If Saturdays are so busy, maybe we should pay more for those days? I just want it to be fair for everyone.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,George,,"@Minato, paying more for busy days is just another way to keep score. The other households said the asking itself is the poison. We need a system that stops the asking.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@George, I agree. The handover state proves the current system fails. We need a structure that removes the need for constant checking.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
