67,3,1,talk,Minato,,"@Misaki, I like Option A. If we pay for the distance, it feels fair. I hope it helps us stop guessing about the money.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,George,,"@Toshio, Option A still requires recording every distance. That is the checking spell that made us feel accused. I reject it.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
