73,3,3,talk,George,,"@Misaki, Option B’s fixed days remove the need to ask or verify. It stops the favour-asking that sours trust. I support B.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Toshio,,"@George, Option B eliminates the verification labor. Fixed days mean no recording, no checking, no untangling. It is the only structure that removes the hidden cost. I support B.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Toshio, I agree. Option B’s fixed days guarantee the car is ready for me without constant checking. I support B.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
