77,3,3,talk,Minato,,"@Misaki, I understand your worry. But if we don't count, we can just trust each other. I think Option B is the kindest way to stop the guessing.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,George,,I am voting for Option B. It removes the asking and the checking that sours our trust. We must stop the friction before it breaks us.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
